From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:51:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/47] r4-prep C: island-only sky dome, cloud layer and gulls
 fade out over the lakeside arrival (w 0.6-0.95), restored on leave

The lakeside far hills/shore are in the journey from the set-off and come in as the layered fog thins with the
blend weight; the island-only props then fade out (dome/cloud: their existing instance switched to alpha blend
for the window only, shared states restored at fade 1; gulls: scaled out and hidden, no calls) so the far view is
the same set on both sides of the swap and the journey end sky is the camera clear colour the board also uses.
No new node/material/draw. Test: tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_far_view.cjs (lakeside-far-view).
